>
> I was wondering what the reasons/benefits are for using non-overlapping windows? I have spoken to individuals who prefer using a smaller step size (very overlapping windows) so as not to miss something interesting that happens to be located in an otherwise uninteresting window.
>
> Hope this is clear! Id love to get your opinion on this.
>
> Many Thanks

